<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bouygues started strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bouygues started strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Janice Rudd confirmed she initiated coverage of Bouygues Offshore SA on Monday with a strong buy and a price target of $20 a share.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed on Friday at 11-3/4.</p>
</text>
